<title>RUSSIA: Russian MinFins firm on correction after fall.</title>
<headline>Russian MinFins firm on correction after fall.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian MinFins firmed in a reaction to several days of falling prices and dealers said the end to the Brady downtrend could also encourage banks to buy at lower levels.</p>
</text>
